# MM_* settings added to the Mattermost container's environment, both on a PR
# preview (pr-preview's instance/docker-compose.yml) and in the local stack
# (docker-compose.dev.yml), so the two stay in step. Only MM_ settings,
# comments and blank lines are allowed; anything else fails the preview deploy.
# Settings the preview's own compose file already sets win there.
#
# Example: turn on a feature flag the plugin depends on.
# MM_FEATUREFLAGS_MANAGEDCHANNELCATEGORIES=true
